---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../../styles/privacy.css';
import { translationsFor } from '../../i18n/routes';
---
<Base
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy Policy | NS Reptiles"
  description="NS Reptiles privacy policy: what personal data we collect through the contact form, how we use and store it, which cookies we use and your rights."
  path="/en/privacy-policy.html"
  ogDescription="Information about the collection and processing of personal data, cookies and user rights."
  translations={translationsFor("/en/privacy-policy.html")}
>
<section class="page-head">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="eyebrow">Legal Information</div>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>
          How we collect, use and protect your personal data, and what rights
          you have regarding them.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
<section class="doc">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="doc-updated">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
            <path d="M12 7v5l3 2"></path>
          </svg>
          Last updated: 17 February 2026
        </div>

        <div class="doc-sec">
          <h2>Who collects the data</h2>
          <p>
            Your personal data is collected by <strong>NS Reptiles</strong>, an
            exotic animal breeder based in Novi Sad, Serbia. For any questions
            regarding data protection, you can contact us at
            <a href="mailto:bata.dino00@gmail.com">bata.dino00@gmail.com</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-sec">
          <h2>What data is collected</h2>
          <p>
            Through the contact form on our website, we collect the following
            data:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Full name</li>
            <li>Email address</li>
            <li>Message content</li>
            <li>IP address (when submitting the contact form)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-sec">
          <h2>Purpose of data collection</h2>
          <p>
            We use your data exclusively for the purpose of responding to your
            inquiry and further communication related to our products and
            services. We do not use your data for marketing without your
            explicit consent and do not share it with third parties.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-sec">
          <h2>Where data is stored</h2>
          <p>
            Data collected through the contact form is stored on the HubSpot
            platform (cloud service), which applies industry-standard data
            protection measures. More information about HubSpot's privacy policy
            can be found on their website.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-sec">
          <h2>Cookies</h2>
          <p>Our website uses the following cookies and tracking tools:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <strong>Google Analytics</strong> - for analysing website traffic
              and user behaviour
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Google Tag Manager</strong> - for managing scripts and
              tracking conversions
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>HubSpot tracking</strong> - for tracking interactions with
              the contact form
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            These tools may place cookies in your browser to collect anonymised
            data about website usage.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-sec">
          <h2>Data retention period</h2>
          <p>
            We retain your personal data as long as there is a business need, or
            until the purpose for which it was collected is fulfilled. Upon your
            request, we will delete your data as soon as possible.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-sec">
          <h2>Your rights</h2>
          <p>Regarding your personal data, you have the right to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <strong>Access</strong> - request to see the data we hold about
              you
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Rectification</strong> - request correction of inaccurate
              data
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Erasure</strong> - request deletion of your data
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Withdrawal of consent</strong> - withdraw your consent for
              data processing at any time
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-sec">
          <h2>Contact for requests</h2>
          <p>
            For all questions, requests and complaints regarding the protection
            of your personal data, you can contact us:
          </p>
          <div class="doc-contact">
            <div class="row">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"></rect>
                <path d="M2 7l10 6 10-6"></path>
              </svg>
              <a href="mailto:bata.dino00@gmail.com">bata.dino00@gmail.com</a>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 01-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 01-8.6-3 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6 19.8 19.8 0 01-3-8.6A2 2 0 014.1 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.7c.1.9.3 1.8.6 2.6a2 2 0 01-.5 2.1L8.1 9.9a16 16 0 006 6l1.5-1.1a2 2 0 012.1-.5c.8.3 1.7.5 2.6.6a2 2 0 011.7 2z"></path>
              </svg>
              <a href="tel:+381693301474">+381 69 330 1474</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


</Base>
